nts appear at the bottom until revealed. The Group Adventure empty-state message is shorter.\r\n- The jukebox restores your selected music after an event, including newly collected tracks. Music switches reevaluate playback, and background MIDI music plays at a more consistent level.\r\n\r\nAndroid build 10075. Existing progress and running adventures are preserved.\r\n"}